					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-4967144#post-3687026</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-4967144/a-diminished-thing#post-3687026</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Fri, 19 Jan 2018 23:17:36 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>PeppersGhost</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1553042</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <div style="text-align: center;"> <p><em>The bird would cease and be as other birds<br /> But that he knows in singing not to sing.<br /> The question that he frames in all but words<br /> Is what to make of a diminished thing.</em></p> </div> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> Please enjoy this facetious melodrama inspired by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/daveyoufool" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2034230&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1527276226" alt="daveyoufool" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2034230)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/daveyoufool" >daveyoufool</a></span> and Robert Frost.</p> <p>Special thanks to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/the-great-hippo" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3938622&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1527276226" alt="The Great Hippo" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3938622)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/the-great-hippo" >The Great Hippo</a></span> for looking at this one!</p> <p><sup>also hi there it's me again</sup></p> <hr /> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p>Discover more of my weird ramblings in<br /> <span style="font-size:125%;"><strong><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/dr-john-peppersghost-pepper-s-personnel-file">~PeppersGhost's Gallery of Illusion!~</a></strong></span></p> </div> <hr /> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
